WEBVTT

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:13.140
A drifter doesn't
need a woman.

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:18.180
Forget about an unfaithful
guy like me

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:20.760
and find yourself someone
more devoted.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.760
So that's how it is...

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:41.040
I thought you didn't go for
women with big earrings.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.670
That was before.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.500
I see.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:53.410
Akemi, thanks for
the wonderful memories.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:23.790
Bastard!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.540
Ten o'clock...

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.930
Dammit!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.370
Thanks for helping me.
She's more than I can handle.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.630
Yes.

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:08.530
Is it okay to hold her?

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.050
How else are you going
to carry her?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.410
Yes, you're right.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:19.390
I'll help you.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.600
That's all right.
It's easier this way.

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.670
Akemi sure is heavy!

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:37.580
I'm so sorry about this.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.850
Hiroshi, is that you?

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:45.920
You came back to me!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.300
You're making a mistake!
It's me!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.390
I'm so happy!

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:00.600
Akemi!

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.410
Drunk or not

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:08.350
as Godai's landlady,
I can't condone your...!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:18.620
What was that for?!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.520
Get out!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.030
I'm so sorry.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.890
I'm always willing.

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:33.910
What I meant was
I'm always willing to help.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.070
You have lipstick on
your lips.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:38.870
You, too.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:06.210
I wish it were the manager.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.450
Ouch!

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:33.700
'Mornin'.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:35.220
Morning.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:39.920
How're you feeling?

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:41.210
The pits.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:45.280
Did I say something
yesterday?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.310
Well...

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:50.550
What is it?

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.810
If there's...

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.530
...anything I can do
to help, just ask.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:00.590
What? Nice try, kid.

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.300
B-But...

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:07.360
Maybe ten years from now.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:17.170
I think he was trying
to tell me something.

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:24.490
What happened last night?

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:34.680
Sorry about last night.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:37.770
You and your beau break up?

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.090
You might say so.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:43.070
What's one light bulb if
it helps you forget.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:50.600
And so? Does your beau
resemble Godai?

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.450
Not a bit.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.290
So don't worry.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.450
It doesn't bother me.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.610
We're all past the age of
getting excited over a kiss.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.850
That's true!

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.470
Hi! On your way to work?

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.540
What's got you so antsy?

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.080
N-Nothing.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:34.720
Snap out of it, or
you'll get run over.

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:36.880
Hey Godai!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.460
Here, you can have this.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:44.620
For me?

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:48.800
Don't need it anymore.
Throw it away if you want.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.430
I wouldn't do that.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.530
She knows I gave up smoking.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.880
Could Akemi have feelings
for me?

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.480
Nah, couldn't be.

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:20.290
Chachamaru

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:36.310
Godai... Don't force yourself.
Didn't you quit?

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:37.750
I did, but...

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.790
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:42.550
About what?

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:46.660
He's here like you said!

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.290
I win.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:51.040
What's that about?

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.470
We had a ten yen bet on
your whereabouts.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.560
What did you just try
to hide?!

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:59.100
None of your business,
Yotsuya.

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:03.710
Wanna wager 30 yen that Godai switches
from the manager to Akemi?

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.080
Sounds interesting!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:06.640
Don't be ridiculous.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.160
She's right.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.010
Oh really?

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.710
Tell us all about it.

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:15.590
Your treat, of course.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:18.160
Hey! What're we gonna
talk about?!

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:19.120
Just come.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.840
Hello. Chachamaru.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.310
Who was that from?

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:41.250
Wrong number.

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.180
Someone tried to order
two bowls of noodles.

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:47.460
What a bother!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.370
Master, I'm going out
for some cigarettes.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.800
Cigarettes?
We have lots.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:01.600
Hey, the phone!

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:03.220
Akemi!

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:04.880
Don't try to run away!

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:09.930
Master, let me get that.
I'm expecting this call.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.620
Hello. It's me.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.780
Who're you?!

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:48.670
Okay...

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.960
I've got the gist of it.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.850
Can I really trust you?

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:57.960
My card.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:01.780
Kennosuke Yotsuya?

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:04.760
It's written "Kennosuke"
but read "Gorobei."

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:08.590
People call me "Honest Goro."

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.740
I have a request.

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:15.810
I'm not sure that
I got everything.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.570
Could you write her a letter?

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.500
Forget it!

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:38.430
It's always been said
A commitment unfulfilled
is a debt unpaid.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:54.840
He's still here.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.040
It's already been an hour.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:04.920
What should we do?

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.630
Nothin' we can do...

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.330
Too bad there isn't a man
we could rely on for help.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.160
You were home?

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.540
Huh?

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.620
I didn't think Godai
had it in him!

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:05.960
Yes...

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:08.840
Victory!

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:13.690
The fool! It's gone
to his head already!

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:19.000
Your tea.

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.030
Thanks.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:23.530
So he's the guy who
dumped Akemi.

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:25.070
What else did you learn?

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:26.330
That's it.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.840
Is that all?!
That couldn't be.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.810
He wanted me to tell her
he came by.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:36.240
Hmm... Maybe he wants to
make up with her.

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:50.260
I made up my mind
to forget you.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.380
But you haven't.

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:54.630
I hate to admit it.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:57.600
That girl is a waste
of time.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:01.100
Chicks with huge earrings
just don't cut it.

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.060
You're cruel. She's probably
crying right now.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:09.070
Give me a break!
I'm asking you to come back.

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.780
You know you need me.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.090
That's what I like about you.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:27.460
Let's go on a trip.
We can start all over.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:32.340
Tomorrow night at eight.
Pier 5. At the ferry dock.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.260
I'll be waiting.

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:49.530
You drinkin'?

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.140
I'm drinking.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:55.530
You don't call that drinking.
You call that "sipping."

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:59.160
Still thinking about
the time we kissed?

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:00.960
Not in front everyone!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.820
We already know.

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.960
Lucky you, Godai.

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.260
Next time, kiss me, too.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:17.990
I met that guy the other day.
Hiroshi, was it?

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:21.160
Did he say anything?

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:24.530
I suggested that
he write you a letter.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.160
I thinks it's too
late for that.

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:42.960
By the way, Godai, how's
it going with Kozue?

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:47.640
Subtle! You didn't ask
about the manager!

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:50.490
With either one
the answer's the same.

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:53.260
No progress!

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:56.510
Mind your own business!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:02.460
I made some oden.
Would you like some?

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:05.350
--Thanks!
--Just what I wanted!

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:07.260
Daikon...please.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:08.740
Any fishcake?

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:10.580
Be careful, it's hot.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.620
What happened last night
after that?

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:23.680
The usual. They had a grand time
at my expense.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:26.170
Sorry to hear that.

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.420
It's no big deal.

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:30.830
Are you going on a trip?

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:33.890
I need a change of pace.

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:35.140
That's nice.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.250
Wanna come?

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:38.660
Can I?

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:41.800
Don't take me seriously.
See ya!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:43.530
Have a good time!

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:46.970
I think she's gotten
over it.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:47.880
Yes.

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.380
Gosh, I need to get going.
See you later.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:54.580
'Bye!

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.420
Clock Hill Station

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.720
Thanks. I'll take that now.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:09.950
Don't you catch your train
on the opposite platform?

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:13.760
Yeah. Say, I'll return this
to you.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:17.540
It's not "me," and besides...

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:19.130
I know, I know.

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.410
You don't want to hurt
the manager's feelings.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:26.800
Your train's coming.

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:29.300
Have a good trip.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:36.890
He's sweet...

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:09.200
Hello. Maison Ikkoku.

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:13.300
Yes.
What?! Really?

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:15.850
She's not there, either?

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.490
No, she hasn't told
me anything.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:56.730
We have no way to find her.

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.130
She said she was taking
a trip, right?

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:01.660
Yes. For a change of pace,
she said.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.200
Alone?

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:04.970
I doubt it.

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.700
If it's by herself...

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:09.140
Stop it! Akemi would never
commit suicide!

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:10.170
Godai!

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:44.090
Sorry I'm late!

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:46.050
Sorry, Master.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:50.480
Akemi...!

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.120
Where were you?

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:54.380
Why's everyone together?

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.950
It's too quiet for a party.

00:21:57.590 --> 00:21:59.280
We need music.

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:04.090
Time to get to work.

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:05.830
What'll you all have?

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:46.880
I'm freezing in here!

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:52.090
Shut up!
This'll only take a minute!

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:55.090
What's with those huge
earrings, anyway!

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:21.340
Stop it, Mrs. Ichinose!

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:26.840
But it's so funny!

00:23:49.670 --> 00:23:54.190
It all began on a quiet
and boring Sunday afternoon

00:23:54.610 --> 00:23:57.870
when my full-length
mirror was delivered.

00:23:58.730 --> 00:24:03.180
Next: "Crazy Costume Contest!
Kyoko's Amazing Transformation!"

00:24:03.530 --> 00:24:06.540
If you feel sorry for me,
let me change out of these clothes!
